{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84c25fe872688c0ee595297bb203513a1329aa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a @ b = \\frac{a\\times b}{a+b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"98\" height=\"39\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> positive integers, then what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830ebac156483d8adf2883e383842133539fc4f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 @10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa9f842c6086afec7875213b85b4be7add9c501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{3}{10} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{10}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"384\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53897e4b47f6049266b4bffcef91bc949385b5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c6598c0475f72c14c1bc58cb116cde326decce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> into the expression for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/985de53eef178f8b1d217af25bcd99860ef5c14c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a @ b$\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/2/de297a7475c05dded0464c61f6c9863323152457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 @ 10 = \\frac{5\\times 10}{5+10} = \\frac{50}{15} = \\frac{10}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"210\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Thus, answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/a/3ca2f47c247f4c9119731dffa53aae8f3fdcfcf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{10}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"69\" height=\"48\" /> is correct.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks\">Video by MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EEbksvfujhk\">https://youtu.be/EEbksvfujhk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZCpSVVCejpU\">https://youtu.be/ZCpSVVCejpU</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8\">2010 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofp